           constraint            |                    comment                    
---------------------------------+-----------------------------------------------
 comment_test_pk                 | PRIMARY KEY constraint of comment_test
 comment_test_positive_col_check | CHECK constraint on comment_test.positive_col
(2 rows)

---END---
